            <div class="heroOverlay">
                <div class="heroContent">
                    <span>From aroma, a world unfolds</span>
                    <h1>Scents to stir the imagination</h1>
                    <p>
                        Our transportive fragrances for self and surrounds-candles, Eaux de Parfum, room sprays, incense and oil
